# Local artifacts, never versioned
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
**/.eslintrc.js
**/lwc/.eslintrc.json
**/profilePasswordPolicies/*
**/appMenus/AppSwitcher.appMenu-meta.xml
**/settings/*
# except this one: it allows deployments while a scheduled Apex job exists,
# which Lab 2.4 creates and every later deployment needs
!**/settings/Deployment.settings-meta.xml
**/networks/*
**/siteDotComSites/*
**/objectTranslations/*
**/standardValueSets/*

# Temporary technical fields from the 2025 capacity spike, not versioned.
# TODO remove once the spike is over  (Sofia, 2025-11)
**/objects/Installation__c/fields/Crew_W*.field-meta.xml

# The lines sfdx-hardis expects in every project. Without them, the release manager
# commands of Level 3 stop to offer an upgrade of this file.
**/appMenu/**
**/appSwitcher/**
**/connectedApps/**
**/certs/**
**/profilePasswordPolicies/**
**/__tests__/**
**SfdxHardisDeferSharingRecalc**
